authors.binary.note = Each file of the round counts once, by the votes of all its jurors: approved (at least one yes), rejected by all (votes cast, no yes) or not voted yet (no vote cast, including a file nobody is assigned), so the three add up to the author''s files, each with its share of them. Approval rate: the yes votes among all the yes and no votes cast on the author''s files, comparable whatever the number of jurors per file; — without any vote.
