job.error.join.gone = Account #{0} or #{1} no longer exists or is retired: the join has stopped.
job.error.join.round.busy = Round {0} is getting its files or a new juror right now: Retry the join once that is done.
job.error.join.collision = Round {0}: {1} files have a vote of both accounts. Fix them by hand, then Retry.
job.error.join.invariant = Round {0}: moving the votes would break the round''s files'' consistency; nothing was moved in it.
job.error.join.retire.busy = A round of a contest of account #{0} is getting its files or a new juror right now: Retry the join once that is done.
job.error.join.retire.refused = Account #{0} could not be retired ({1}): Retry once that is fixed.
users.not.added.joining = Not added, the account being joined with another account: {0}.
account.join.in.progress = This account is being joined with another account: its role and password can''t change until the join has finished. Nothing was saved.
job.error.join.performer = Account #{0}, which started the join, may no longer join these accounts: Retry as root or as an admin of every contest of both.
account.join.abandon = Abandon this join
account.join.abandon.help = Root only: stop this failed join for good. The rounds it has moved stay with the account kept, which also gets the other account''s membership in their contests; everything else stays with the other account, which is not retired. Both accounts can sign in again.
account.join.abandoned = This join was abandoned: the rounds it moved, and the memberships of their contests, stay with the account kept; everything else stays with the other account. Both accounts can sign in again.
account.join.abandon.not.failed = Only a failed join can be abandoned.
account.join.abandon.cancel.instead = Nothing has moved yet: cancel this join instead.
account.join.merge.explain = A file only one account rated, the other having it unrated (an assignment), keeps the vote: it is merged, not a collision.
job.cancel.join.started = This join has moved votes already and can''t be cancelled: Retry it instead.
job.error.rebalance.joining = Account {0} is being joined with another account: add it once the join has finished.
round.review.distribute.joining = Round {0}: account #{1} is being joined with another account. Choose the jurors again once the join has finished.
